ARM GAS  /tmp/ccHOgNj3.s 			page 25


 933:Core/Src/main.c ****              * clears the shared delay line. Runs from the main loop while the
 934:Core/Src/main.c ****              * ISR keeps calling HCA_Process, so the controller sees the state
 935:Core/Src/main.c ****              * vanish mid-sample -- that is the point of the command, but it does
 936:Core/Src/main.c ****              * put a transient on the output. The ~16KB memset costs roughly one
 937:Core/Src/main.c ****              * 40kHz ISR period.
